[* 
json.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Small JSON parsing and serialization helpers over the native json module.

Conventions:
- JSON arrays become normal Raden lists.
- JSON objects become lists of (key value) pair lists.
- Lists of (key value) pairs stringify back to JSON objects.

Loading behavior:
This module chooses the shared-library suffix from __sharedlib_ext and loads:
../nativelibs/json(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- parse     : json-text -> value
- stringify : value -> json-text
*]

"../nativelibs/json" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative

parse defun
    parseJson call
end

stringify defun
    stringifyJson call
end
